{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Model request failures — agreed\n\nAccepted in D-046.\nOne bounded retry before output for temporary connection errors.\nInterrupted output and completed changes remain visible.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]\n[[Run Lifecycle - Approvals.canvas]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Model request is active\n\nA text-only reply or a later request after tools.\nVisible text is provisional.\nTool proposals wait for successful response completion.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Connection/request fails\n\nRecord the actual failure.\nNo final-answer success marker.\nGranite can show the error itself without another model call.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "check",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Retry eligible?\n\nTemporary connection/server error.\nNo text or tool-call data emitted.\nOne retry remains and fits the run budget.\nNo Stop, expiry or deletion.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "retry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## One automatic retry\n\nShow Reconnecting briefly.\nRetry with valid current context.\nNever replay completed tools.\nKeep the same run.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "normal",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Response succeeds\n\nRejoin normal provisional streaming and completed-response inspection.\nExecute permitted tools only after successful response completion.\n[[Run Lifecycle - Text Only.canvas]]",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "interrupted",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Preserve incomplete output\n\nKeep any partial text as interrupted.\nDo not execute tool proposals from the incomplete response.\nWrong credentials/settings: explain the correction needed.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "failed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Finish the failed run\n\nShow the error and a Continue action.\nKeep conversation and known outcomes.\nCompleted repository changes remain visible in the diff/counts.\nNo automatic rollback.",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "continue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## User chooses Continue\n\nOnce connection is usable, start a new run in the same chat.\nRevalidate location, retention and permissions.\nDo not replay old tool calls.",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "new_run",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Resume from actual state\n\nTask + steering + relevant history + interruption + actual outcomes.\nInspect files before more edits.\nEstablish a new run/change record.",
      "x": 3300,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "changes",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Preserve completed edits\n\nA failed answer does not mean a previous edit failed.\nKeep actual changes and outcomes.\nStop also keeps edits (D-067).",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "history",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Valid provider history\n\nDo not turn partial tool arguments into completed calls.\nNever invent successful execution.\nUnknown/partial tool effects need reconciliation before more writes.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "priority",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Respect current controls\n\nPending steering reaches the retry.\nStop/deletion wins.\nRetries keep their run limits.\nTemporary timer stays full during active work, then counts down.\nNo silent provider switch.",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "undo",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Continue starts a new run\n\nLater Stop keeps its completed edits too.\nAutomatic restoration and Undo UI are deferred.\n\n[[Deferred File Restoration]]",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
